Resolve a barcode (EAN/UPC/GTIN), a vendor's own product code and/or free text such as a receipt line ("BARILLA SPAG 0,5KG") to Homebox items. Exact code matches are tried first, then hybrid semantic and lexical search. The result says whether the top candidate is a confident match; if it is not, ask the user which candidate is right. Does not change anything.
